	(text "Radio port (D-71, D-72, D-77, D-78, D-85 to D-91). One sheet, three instances: R1 (FT-710), R2, R3. Mini-DIN 8 on the root sheet.\nSides as on the root block: logic inputs on the top edge, TX_EN on the bottom edge, mini-DIN pins and the panel LED on the right edge.\nTX INH: LED current only with PERMIT AND TX_EN; no current (unpowered, stop, no permit) = contact closed = inhibit.\nINH LEVEL: 1-2 HIGH (5.1 V from the radio +13V OUT via RH and DZ), 2-3 LOW (radio GND), removed = not used. FT-710: HIGH expected (A-15, A-18).\nKeying: KEY AND INH_ON. PIN1 SEL: KEY (R2, R3) or BAND D (R1). BAND A to D to the expander on R1 only (root).\nTX sense: SENSE A and SENSE K both 1-2 = CONTACT (FEED SEL: radio +13V OUT or interface 13.8 V), both 2-3 = VOLTAGE.\nGND BOND: radio GND to interface GND; close on R1 and with the interface feed. Otherwise the port floats.\nRGND = radio GND of this port (local net). Each mini-DIN line: TVS 15 V and 1 nF to RGND at the connector; RGND to CHASSIS by 10 nF 1 kV."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
